00:13:43.114 --> 00:13:44.254
Muscle Ohkama!

00:13:44.254 --> 00:13:45.844
We thought you went to the museum!

00:13:45.924 --> 00:13:49.394
I just accidentally went to the zoo next door!

00:13:49.394 --> 00:13:52.424
But I figured the station would
have a more accurate map,

00:13:52.424 --> 00:13:54.664
so I headed back there.

00:13:54.664 --> 00:13:55.994
Epic win.

00:13:55.994 --> 00:13:59.994
We're not letting you get that
gold statue of whatever it is!

00:14:00.304 --> 00:14:01.334
Idiot...

00:14:01.334 --> 00:14:02.574
She told him.

00:14:02.574 --> 00:14:05.004
Oh, so you know that much, do you?

00:14:05.004 --> 00:14:07.014
Then that simplifies everything!

00:14:07.014 --> 00:14:08.944
I'm taking you hostage!

00:14:08.944 --> 00:14:09.674
For heisting the statue and making my escape!

00:14:09.674 --> 00:14:11.164
Lemme go, you!
For heisting the statue and making my escape!

00:14:11.244 --> 00:14:13.804
Stop it! Take me hostage in her place!

00:14:14.384 --> 00:14:16.584
In my place? You're a Normal!

00:14:16.584 --> 00:14:18.854
Exactly. I have no psychic powers.

00:14:18.854 --> 00:14:21.094
Right, so quit trying to be the hero!

00:14:21.094 --> 00:14:23.684
You're supposed to use espers
for situations like this.

00:14:24.164 --> 00:14:28.424
I don't care that you're espers!
You're all still just little girls!

00:14:30.004 --> 00:14:33.694
You're not wild animals.
You're mankind's precious future!

00:14:33.974 --> 00:14:36.494
And protecting that precious future...

00:14:36.574 --> 00:14:38.874
is the duty we adults must bear!

00:14:43.344 --> 00:14:45.874
Honey, now that I look at you, you're kinda hot.

00:14:47.154 --> 00:14:50.654
I only have eyes for gold
and guys with hot bods!

00:14:50.654 --> 00:14:52.454
Change of hostages!

00:14:53.324 --> 00:14:55.914
Don't you dare lay a finger on these girls!

00:14:56.194 --> 00:14:59.264
Oh, please! I'm SO not into kids.

00:14:59.264 --> 00:15:01.734
Now that that's settled,
let's get down to business!

00:15:01.734 --> 00:15:04.664
Okay, now where's that museum?

00:15:13.104 --> 00:15:14.414
Darn it!

00:15:14.414 --> 00:15:15.214
Kaoru...

00:15:15.214 --> 00:15:16.374
Kaoru.

00:15:16.714 --> 00:15:20.154
If you guys had even slightly
developed boobs and butts,

00:15:20.154 --> 00:15:22.484
this could have been such
a super-sexy situation.

00:15:22.484 --> 00:15:25.114
THAT'S what you're thinking
about in this predicament?

00:15:28.494 --> 00:15:31.194
Shiho, what did he?

00:15:31.194 --> 00:15:33.664
He told me "I'll release that
limiter, no matter what."

00:15:33.664 --> 00:15:35.684
"Leave this to me. Don't worry."

00:15:35.894 --> 00:15:39.354
La-lala-la la... Okay, it should be straight ahead.

00:15:40.404 --> 00:15:42.334
Our very own escape tunnel of love!

00:15:42.334 --> 00:15:45.004
MUSCLE DRILL!

00:15:59.784 --> 00:16:01.494
"Leave this to me," huh?

00:16:01.494 --> 00:16:03.794
Who is he, anyway?

00:16:03.794 --> 00:16:06.394
Koichi Minamoto. Age: 20.

00:16:06.394 --> 00:16:08.534
Medical researcher for BABEL,

00:16:08.534 --> 00:16:12.264
the government special esper
support laboratory.

00:16:12.904 --> 00:16:14.234
And a Normal.

00:16:14.234 --> 00:16:16.634
You were able to read that
much from his thoughts?

00:16:16.634 --> 00:16:19.334
No, what I just said, I read from his ID card.

00:16:19.404 --> 00:16:20.414
Oh.

00:16:20.414 --> 00:16:22.874
I wonder if he'll be able to release our limiters.

00:16:22.874 --> 00:16:24.584
Even if he fails,

00:16:24.584 --> 00:16:28.314
if we return to headquarters,
we'll ask to have them removed.

00:16:28.784 --> 00:16:31.924
The only person at risk here
as the hostage is him.

00:16:31.924 --> 00:16:32.784
That guy.

00:16:32.954 --> 00:16:34.714
NATIONAL MUSEUM

00:16:40.694 --> 00:16:42.564
WE HAVE ARRIVED!

00:16:43.734 --> 00:16:45.034
EEEK!

00:16:45.034 --> 00:16:47.864
My lovely treasure! At last, we meet!

00:16:53.714 --> 00:16:57.114
If I don't do something, he's going to get away!

00:16:57.114 --> 00:17:01.344
C'mon, think! If I were Supervisor
Suma, what password would I set?

00:17:01.884 --> 00:17:04.214
They're collars, but she
called them magic rings...

00:17:05.284 --> 00:17:07.054
Rings that let you talk to wild animals!

00:17:10.294 --> 00:17:11.354
Got it!

00:17:15.294 --> 00:17:16.194
Our limiters!

00:17:16.194 --> 00:17:17.664
They've been released!

00:17:18.234 --> 00:17:20.734
He did it!

00:17:20.734 --> 00:17:22.474
Okay, teleport us!

00:17:22.474 --> 00:17:25.564
Aoi, do you remember where the museum is?

00:17:25.644 --> 00:17:26.134
Oh.

00:17:26.444 --> 00:17:28.844
Okay, we're all set!

00:17:29.274 --> 00:17:32.744
Why so many?! Aren't you just
after the gold statue?!

00:17:32.744 --> 00:17:36.314
Oh, but the others are just so musclely!

00:17:36.554 --> 00:17:40.224
Now, shall we make our escape before the
boobs from BABEL get wise to this?

00:17:40.224 --> 00:17:41.914
Not so fast!

00:17:42.524 --> 00:17:43.924
Who?!

00:17:44.094 --> 00:17:47.424
One! When evil runs rampant
in the world of men...

00:17:48.364 --> 00:17:51.664
Two! We wield fantastic powers...

00:17:52.604 --> 00:17:53.934
Three!

00:17:54.374 --> 00:17:56.604
And royally kick their butts!

00:17:58.344 --> 00:18:01.104
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:18:02.644 --> 00:18:05.304
Girls! What was with the explosions?

00:18:05.684 --> 00:18:08.584
I guess we messed up and turned it
into a hero show entrance, huh?

00:18:08.584 --> 00:18:10.174
Thanks for playing hostage!

00:18:11.484 --> 00:18:13.514
What?! Oh, you little!

00:18:13.824 --> 00:18:15.654
Say your prayers, Muscle Ohkama!

00:18:15.654 --> 00:18:18.654
You think you can take us on
with our limiters released?

00:18:18.994 --> 00:18:21.194
Oh, you insolent little brats!

00:18:21.194 --> 00:18:23.724
Serves me right for sparing you before!

00:18:23.964 --> 00:18:27.634
SUPER BIG MAGNUM!

00:18:30.074 --> 00:18:31.734
Magnum! Magnum! Magnum!

00:18:32.004 --> 00:18:33.804
Eat this!

00:18:37.114 --> 00:18:38.804
Way to go, Aoi!

00:18:40.114 --> 00:18:41.844
Kaoru! He's targeting you!

00:18:42.314 --> 00:18:44.184
Too late!

00:18:47.594 --> 00:18:49.524
Let me be in time!

00:18:50.264 --> 00:18:51.594
PAWN

00:18:51.964 --> 00:18:53.794
GOLD GENERAL

00:18:53.794 --> 00:18:55.054
GOLD GENERAL
He turned that pawn to metal!

00:18:55.364 --> 00:18:57.294
That's what I call a promotion!

00:18:57.504 --> 00:19:00.664
All right! Psychic...

00:19:02.304 --> 00:19:05.634
GOLDEN ATTACK!

00:19:07.444 --> 00:19:08.374
NO!

00:19:11.714 --> 00:19:15.844
Oh. I get it... Gold, 'cuz I was stealing... gold...

00:19:16.484 --> 00:19:18.314
Hah! How'd you like that?!

00:19:27.264 --> 00:19:29.564
What's the meaning of this?

00:19:29.564 --> 00:19:31.124
Do you suppose the girls?

00:19:31.804 --> 00:19:34.234
Okay, Muslce Ohkama! Prepare to be!

00:19:34.304 --> 00:19:35.324
Huh?

00:19:38.104 --> 00:19:41.094
Dammit! I won't forget this, brats!

00:19:42.044 --> 00:19:43.374
Say...

00:19:43.744 --> 00:19:45.804
What did the password turn out to be?

00:19:46.444 --> 00:19:47.754
Solomon.

00:19:47.754 --> 00:19:51.084
The name of a king in the Old Testament.

00:19:51.084 --> 00:19:54.154
He had a magic ring that let him talk to animals.

00:19:54.154 --> 00:19:55.744
Animals?

00:19:56.594 --> 00:19:59.424
I think, in her own way, she was thinking of you.

00:19:59.964 --> 00:20:04.104
Solomon was a great king,
renowned for his wisdom.

00:20:04.104 --> 00:20:07.534
I'm sure she wanted to teach you to use
your great powers responsibly.

00:20:13.744 --> 00:20:15.934
You tried really hard. That must have hurt.

00:20:21.084 --> 00:20:23.844
I'm fine! I'm strong, okay?!

00:20:23.984 --> 00:20:26.584
Did I say something wrong?

00:20:31.364 --> 00:20:33.564
CHILDREN!

00:20:33.564 --> 00:20:36.254
You're not hurt, are you?!

00:20:37.234 --> 00:20:39.254
I was so worried!

00:20:39.604 --> 00:20:41.934
Um, Chief?

00:20:43.774 --> 00:20:46.464
Minamoto! What are you doing here?

00:20:47.444 --> 00:20:50.504
Koichi Minamoto has returned, sir.

00:20:50.784 --> 00:20:54.454
I see! I see! I've been waiting for you, Minamoto!

00:20:54.454 --> 00:20:56.974
You must have been leading
The Children at the scene.

00:20:59.084 --> 00:21:01.354
I didn't expect them to catch Muscle.

00:21:01.354 --> 00:21:03.484
He underestimated his opponents!

00:21:04.524 --> 00:21:06.354
Not just that.

00:21:11.934 --> 00:21:14.264
BABEL HEADQUARTERS

00:21:14.674 --> 00:21:16.364
RECEPTION - BABEL HQ

00:21:16.934 --> 00:21:18.804
Welcome.

00:21:18.804 --> 00:21:19.544
Um...

00:21:19.544 --> 00:21:23.214
Koichi Minamoto. Back from a two week's
senior staff training course,

00:21:23.214 --> 00:21:25.144
assigned to the agency as of today.

00:21:25.144 --> 00:21:27.244
We've all been waiting for you.

00:21:31.724 --> 00:21:33.994
So, how do you like your new limiters?

00:21:33.994 --> 00:21:36.824
Minamoto was the one who
developed them for you.

00:21:38.764 --> 00:21:42.364
Anyway, maybe I should reintroduce myself.

00:21:42.364 --> 00:21:47.024
I'm Koichi Minamoto, and from today on
I'll be supervising The Children.

00:21:48.434 --> 00:21:49.734
How do you do?

00:21:50.744 --> 00:21:53.744
I'm a Level 7 psychometrist, so...

00:21:53.744 --> 00:21:55.834
Oh? But I know that.

00:21:57.744 --> 00:21:59.074
You got guts, huh?

00:21:59.684 --> 00:22:03.854
Hmpf! Well, I'm not ready
to take orders from you!

00:22:03.854 --> 00:22:06.724
Now girls, you're all going to be
on the same team now.

00:22:08.194 --> 00:22:10.054
Get along, please!

00:22:10.054 --> 00:22:12.924
Unity, do you hear me? Unity!

00:22:29.544 --> 00:22:34.674
There's no point in hiding it

00:22:34.984 --> 00:22:39.044
I know everything

00:22:39.784 --> 00:22:45.224
It's no mystery, because

00:22:45.594 --> 00:22:50.994
I love you

00:22:51.234 --> 00:22:55.634
Go on, look at me

00:22:55.904 --> 00:23:00.204
Truly, the bond of love we share

00:23:00.204 --> 00:23:02.174
Is absolute!

00:23:02.414 --> 00:23:07.114
An eternal, unchanging

00:23:07.114 --> 00:23:13.754
Absolute declaration to the world
I'll shout from Everest!

00:23:13.754 --> 00:23:18.594
I've accepted it

00:23:18.594 --> 00:23:22.994
The bond of love we share

00:23:22.994 --> 00:23:25.204
Is absolute!

00:23:25.204 --> 00:23:29.634
My wish, when fortune smiles on me

00:23:29.934 --> 00:23:34.044
In San Pietro, I'll swear it to you

00:23:34.044 --> 00:23:36.844
An absolute declaration of love!

00:23:50.054 --> 00:23:50.994
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:50.994 --> 00:23:53.484
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:53.694 --> 00:23:55.534
It's not my fault!

00:23:55.534 --> 00:23:57.634
Then how did this happen?

00:23:57.634 --> 00:23:58.664
It was an accident, okay?!

00:23:58.664 --> 00:24:00.134
There wasn't any other damage.

00:24:00.134 --> 00:24:03.904
The one lucky thing was that you were the
one hurt worst in this, Mr. Minamoto!

00:24:03.904 --> 00:24:07.274
Are you kidding me?! I keep telling you!
At the scene, follow orders!

00:24:07.674 --> 00:24:09.204
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:09.574 --> 00:24:12.914
Episode 2:
"Worry Not! The Tower of BABEL Soars!"

00:24:12.914 --> 00:24:14.554
Come back, Kaoru!

00:24:14.554 --> 00:24:15.054
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:15.054 --> 00:24:16.954
Worry Not!
The Tower of BABEL Soars!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:16.954 --> 00:24:20.014
Worry Not!
The Tower of BABEL Soars!
